    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="12.3[b]">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIAs">VI As</ref> 12.3[b]</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif we hit þus gehealdað, þonne gelyfe ic to Gode, þæt ure frið bið betera, þonne hit æror wæs.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If we observe the provisions as stated above, I believe, before God, that the security of our realm will be better than it has been in the past.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Si hęc ita conseruemus, in (domino) Deo confido (confidimus), quod pax nostra melior erit quam fuit (fuisset) antea.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
